          "_name": "features02",
          "_sourceTheme": "flexm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features02 flexm5\" group=\"Features\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <header>Cards</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Icon\" name=\"showIcon\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icon Color 1\" value=\"#d9a83f\" name=\"icon_1\" condition=\"showIcon\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icon Color 2\" value=\"#f2c968\" name=\"icon_2\" condition=\"showIcon\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Title\" name=\"showCardTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card BG 1\" value=\"#272b2e\" name=\"card_1\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card BG 2\" value=\"#1e2124\" name=\"card_2\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Active Color\" value=\"#7dabab\" name=\"active\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#15171a\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#F2F2F2\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.6\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row items-wrap\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-10\">\n                <div class=\"content-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n                        <b>Δεν σας δίνουμε απλώς software. Σας δίνουμε λύσεις</b></h2>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-10\">\n                <div class=\"items-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"item features-without-image\">\n                        <div class=\"item-wrapper card_1\">\n                            <div class=\"icon-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showIcon\">\n                                <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-devices mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"card-box\">\n                                <div class=\"title-wrap\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showText\">\n                                    <h4 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".item-title, .icon-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                                        <b>SKETCH</b>\n                                    </h4>\n                                    <p class=\"item-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".item-text, .icon-wrapper\">\n                                        A powerful design tool specifically for macOS that is widely used for creating user\n                                        interfaces, websites, and icons.\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item features-without-image\">\n                        <div class=\"item-wrapper card_2\">\n                            <div class=\"icon-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showIcon\">\n                                <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-drag-n-drop-2 mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"card-box\">\n                                <div class=\"title-wrap\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showText\">\n                                    <h4 class=\"item-title_2 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".item-title_2, .icon-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                                        <b>FIGMA</b>\n                                    </h4>\n                                    <p class=\"item-text_2 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".item-text_2, .icon-wrapper\">\n                                        A cloud-based design tool that allows for real-time collaboration. Figma is popular for\n                                        its ability to facilitate team collaboration on design projects.\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item features-without-image\">\n                        <div class=\"item-wrapper card_1\">\n                            <div class=\"icon-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showIcon\">\n                                <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-code mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"card-box\">\n                                <div class=\"title-wrap\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showText\">\n                                    <h4 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".item-title, .icon-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                                        <b>VISUAL STUDIO CODE</b>\n                                    </h4>\n                                    <p class=\"item-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".item-text, .icon-wrapper\">\n                                        A lightweight but powerful code editor from Microsoft, equipped with built-in support\n                                        for JavaScript, TypeScript, and Node.js.\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "ugTWOV2aVX",
          "_anchor": "features02-3",
          "_PHPplaceholders": [],
          "_JSplaceholders": [],
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            ".items-wrapper": {
              "justify-content": "flex-end",
              ".card": {
                "justify-content": "center"
              }
            },
            ".image-wrapper": {
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "margin-bottom": "32px"
              },
              "img": {
                "height": "720px",
                "width": "720px",
                "object-fit": "cover",
                "border-radius": "100% !important",
                "@media (max-width: 1700px)": {
                  "width": "600px",
                  "height": "600px"
                },
                "@media (max-width: 1440px)": {
                  "width": "500px",
                  "height": "500px"
                },
                "@media (max-width: 1200px)": {
                  "width": "400px",
                  "height": "400px"
                },
                "@media (max-width: 768px)": {
                  "width": "260px",
                  "height": "260px"
                },
                "& when not (@fullWidth)": {
                  "width": "500px",
                  "height": "500px",
                  "@media (max-width: 1200px)": {
                    "width": "400px",
                    "height": "400px"
                  },
                  "@media (max-width: 768px)": {
                    "width": "260px",
                    "height": "260px"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".content-wrapper": {
              "padding-left": "120px",
              "@media (max-width: 1200px)": {
                "padding-left": "60px"
              },
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "padding-left": "0"
              },
              "& when (@reverseContent)": {
                "padding-left": "0",
                "padding-right": "120px",
                "@media (max-width: 1200px)": {
                  "padding-right": "60px"
                },
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "padding-right": "0"
                }
              },
              ".mbr-desc": {
                "margin-bottom": "8px"
              },
              ".mbr-section-title": {
                "margin-bottom": "24px"
              },
              ".mbr-text": {
                "margin-bottom": "24px"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-desc": {
              "color": "#272b2e"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#272b2e"
            },
            ".mbr-text, .text-wrapper": {
              "color": "#272b2e"
            }
          },
          "_name": "article01",
          "_sourceTheme": "flexm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article01 flexm5\" group=\"Article\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Description\" name=\"showDesc\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" selected>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#F2F2F2\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#F2F2F2\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.6\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row items-wrapper\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-5 card\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/all-in-one-rundes-logo-new-1254x1254.png\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6 card\">\n                <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <p class=\"mbr-desc mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showDesc\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-desc\">\n                        <b>THE MAIN TASK </b>\n                    </p>\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n                        <b>Understanding client needs and goals, planning and strategy</b>\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                        Engage with clients to understand their business objectives, target audience, brand identity,\n                        and specific requirements for the website.\n                    </p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                        <a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                            GET STARTED NOW\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
